{
  "_readme": [
    "OSM tag -> Google Maps search term. The one hand-maintained artefact of",
    "the city generator: everything else it writes is derived.",
    "",
    "A city's categories are MEASURED, not assumed. `pnpm cities generate`",
    "counts how many nodes each of these tags has inside the city and keeps",
    "only the ones the city actually contains, ranked by count. That is why",
    "`exchange houses` earns a slot in Dubai (108 bureau_de_change nodes",
    "measured in the centre on 2026-08-22) and would not in Manchester.",
    "",
    "Two tags MAY map to the same query - `shop=travel_agency` and",
    "`office=travel_agent` both do - and their counts are summed. Real OSM",
    "tagging is inconsistent and the search term is what gets bought.",
    "",
    "Terms are English. A Lisbon crawl asks Google for `bakeries`, not",
    "`padarias`, and the size of that loss is unmeasured. See ADR 0014.",
    "",
    "Owned by the taxonomy-curator agent. Corrections are welcome as PRs."
  ],
